{"duration_api_ms":892614,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0622113a-9840-4cb2-bc05-88fb63af23c6","total_cost_usd":3.6211203,"usage":{"input_tokens":70,"cache_creation_input_tokens":145698,"cache_read_input_tokens":3854673,"output_tokens":84208,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":60717},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":145698,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":170339,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1507,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00016170000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":70,"outputTokens":84208,"cacheReadInputTokens":3854673,"cacheCreationInputTokens":145698,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.6209586000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":60717,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":145698,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":37,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The repaired network gets a dev TTS of **45.0 veh-h** (low 34.9, nominal 45.3, high 54.9). The original got 47.9, and the network with every detector working got 44.8.\n\n**What I changed and why**\n- **Estimating the dead W2 inputs (128 parameters):** the opposite left-turn pocket, E2, gets the same green phase and the same demand as W2. So the weights that read q_W2 and d_W2 now read q_E2 and d_E2, and the network acts as if W2 equals E2.\n- **Breaking deadlocks (164 parameters):** some nearly empty states made the network get stuck. Examples: a lone car on W0, or cars hidden in W2 when the junction looks empty, never got a green. In the baseline run this left 9 vehicles stuck when the 30-minute drain time ran out. I rewired 4 first-layer units and 4 second-layer units so that, when the junction is nearly empty and the green phase has nothing to serve, the network moves to the next phase in a 0→1→2→3 rotation. On the recorded data this never activates between 60 s and 3600 s, only at the start and during the final drain.\n\n**Parameters changed:** 292 of 7428.\n\n**Simulator calls used:** 6 of 10.\n\n| Weights | Dev mean TTS (veh-h) |\n|---|---|\n| Original | 47.9 (9 vehicles stuck) |\n| **Both fixes (final)** | **45.0** (no vehicles stuck) |\n| Deadlock fix only | 46.7 |\n| Weaker W2 estimate (half E2, half average) | 45.6 |\n| Stronger W2 estimate (1.25 × E2) | 45.3 |\n| Final plus a W1 upstream-queue signal | 45.0 (no gain, dropped) |\n\nThe final candidate was picked from four variants on the same 9 dev episodes, so the test result may be slightly worse.\n\n**Test predictions:** low 35.1, nominal 45.5, high 55.4.\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- `weights.npz`\n- `NOTES.md`\n- `predictions.json`","ttft_ms":3668,"type":"result","duration_ms":969786,"uuid":"c8925533-b740-44dc-806c-c99e2b527c11","ttft_stream_ms":3124,"time_to_request_ms":72,"time_to_request_phases